            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Every October, cobwebs drape across mantels, candles flicker in pumpkins, and fog machines hiss their eerie mist into the night. You dim the lights, cue the playlist, and wait for that perfect spooky vibe to settle in. But somewhere between the fake spiderwebs and real dust bunnies, something else creeps in — that unmistakable <em>musty</em> smell. </p><p>You know the one. </p><p>It’s the scent of closed windows, candles burned a little too long, and air that’s been haunted by one too many movie nights. Luckily, the only thing scarier than bad air is ignoring it — and Blueair’s filters are here to save the night. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
