            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>The Ghosts You Can’t See</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Not all ghosts go “boo.” Some float around unseen — in the form of tiny particles like dust, pet dander, smoke, and pollen. These invisible visitors can linger in the air long after your Halloween party’s over, sneaking into your lungs and making the air feel heavy and stale. </p><p>That’s where Blueair’s HEPASilent™ technology comes inr: a combination of mechanical and electrostatic filtration that traps 99.97% of airborne particles down to 0.1 microns — the kind you can’t see, but that you definitely do breathe. </p><p>So, while your decorations might scream “haunted,” your air will whisper “fresh.” </p><p> </p><h4><strong>A Filter for Every Home</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Every haunted house has its own kind of atmosphere — and every Blueair filter has its own way of keeping it fresh. </p><p>If your home feels like a castle under constant siege from dust or pollen, the <strong>Particle Filter</strong> will come to your rescue. It captures those microscopic intruders, helping your air become pure and crisp. </p><p>If your Halloween style leans toward scented candles, fog machines, or an overenthusiastic use of room spray, you’ll want the <strong>Particle + Carbon Filter</strong> (sometimes called <strong>DualProtection</strong>). It adds a layer of activated carbon to trap odors and gases — the kind of smells that love to linger long after your guests have gone home. </p><p>And for those battling true horror — smoke, smog, or heavy kitchen fumes — the <strong>SmokeBlock Filter</strong> is the hero of the hour. Packed with extra carbon, it fights the toughest airborne villains. Think of it as your air purifier’s heavy-duty armor. </p><p>Even the humble <strong>Pre-Filter</strong>, that washable outer layer on many Blueair models, deserves some spotlight. It catches larger particles — pet hair, lint, the occasional cobweb — before they ever reach the main filter. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
